<!-- Methodology -->
<section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
  <div class="label mb-3">Methodology</div>
  <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold mb-5">How points are calculated.</h2>

  <p class="text-2 mb-5">
    The Filipino POY scoring formula is designed to reward serious tournament results without rewarding pure volume.
    A single deep run in a major series is worth more than a dozen min-cashes in low-stakes events.
  </p>

  <div class="card rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
    <h3 class="font-serif text-lg orange mb-3">The formula</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-2 mb-3">For every cash, points are calculated as:</p>
    <p class="font-serif text-center text-lg orange py-3 px-4 surface-2 rounded mb-4" style="background: var(--surface-2);">
      Points = Buy-in Tier × Field Size Factor × Finish Factor × Region Factor
    </p>
    <p class="text-xs text-3 m-0">All four factors multiply together. A min-cash in a small low-stakes event might yield 5–10 points. A win in a major Asian series can yield 800–1,500.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mb-7">
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5">
      <div class="label mb-2">Buy-in Tier</div>
      <ul class="text-sm text-2 space-y-1">
        <li>Under $500 — <span class="orange">0.5×</span></li>
        <li>$500–$1,500 — <span class="orange">1×</span></li>
        <li>$1,500–$5,000 — <span class="orange">2×</span></li>
        <li>$5,000–$25,000 — <span class="orange">4×</span></li>
        <li>$25,000+ — <span class="orange">8×</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5">
      <div class="label mb-2">Field Size Factor</div>
      <ul class="text-sm text-2 space-y-1">
        <li>Under 50 entries — <span class="orange">0.5×</span></li>
        <li>50–200 — <span class="orange">1×</span></li>
        <li>200–500 — <span class="orange">1.25×</span></li>
        <li>500–1,000 — <span class="orange">1.5×</span></li>
        <li>1,000+ — <span class="orange">2×</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5">
      <div class="label mb-2">Finish Factor</div>
      <ul class="text-sm text-2 space-y-1">
        <li>1st — <span class="orange">100</span></li>
        <li>2nd — <span class="orange">75</span></li>
        <li>3rd — <span class="orange">55</span></li>
        <li>4th–6th — <span class="orange">35</span></li>
        <li>7th–9th — <span class="orange">22</span></li>
        <li>10th–25th — <span class="orange">12</span></li>
        <li>Min-cash — <span class="orange">5</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card rounded-lg p-5">
      <div class="label mb-2">Region Factor</div>
      <ul class="text-sm text-2 space-y-1">
        <li>Philippines — <span class="orange">1.2×</span></li>
        <li>Asia (other) — <span class="orange">1×</span></li>
        <li>Outside Asia — <span class="orange">0.6×</span></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-xs text-3 mt-3 m-0">Filipino POY weights home-region results higher.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="font-serif text-xl mb-3">Eligibility</h3>
